      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这间培育俱乐部有许多辉煌的成绩，\n同时也是实力高强的队伍，\n曾孕育出许多知名选手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eaacc934269270b09d78df4cec2157698c18ba8a64061177b8c958ac87fd1bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
